      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在未来的某一天，那样的日子终将到来吧。\n那就是您在这里，目送着我迈向异世界大门的日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbd1f60ebb7d6c1a4aeb4797db0747fdf0d2a160212ca9fd891da12e5f8956b1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
