      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……有时，我的心中也会感到一阵落寞。\n每当脑海中浮现出没有您身影的、“彼方之地”的景象时。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6be846eb3046fcbadb0dedfc669654c21345a64ee33e4fe1fbdd33070a01fe2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
