    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef36d9c5f9888550a5e13df6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我作为圣女，虽然会在彼岸被人们温柔地接纳并奉上无尽的祝福……。\n但我的心房一隅，必定会时刻萦绕着一抹无法填补的空虚吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16a4099420f47dbb1871b1f5baad5bc6f1f308d24ff2caf7893fc514cab4147a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136007.json",
      "json_path": [
