      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是与您共同看过的风景、彼此分享的美味、\n以及在狂风暴雨中，不曾言弃、一同真诚祈祷的珍贵回忆……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2b754f306a95d32412065c17df2642d5ef9d38d076a8af4f606e41bb27885d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
