      "uid": "zhcn:d9881fd6e6f6071be3fc6cef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我相信那些深藏着的“光芒”，一定能在“彼方之地”替我驱散黑暗、指引前路。\n所以，我想要在当下的这个世界里，编织属于我们的闪耀回忆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bdbc85b6104ff308f3b25ea98154cf1fc32d0abac2b629ffc13648c4df2a3f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
